<widget Home>
<Box class="portal-home">
    <Box class="portal-hero">
        <Box class="portal-hero-inner">
            <Text class="portal-hero-badge">Asgard UI Framework</Text>
            <Text class="portal-hero-title">构建下一代全栈应用</Text>
            <Text class="portal-hero-subtitle">一套类型安全的声明式 UI 框架，支持 AOT 一体化优化，覆盖 9 个平台目标，让全栈开发体验如丝般顺滑。</Text>
            <Box class="portal-hero-actions">
                <button class="portal-btn portal-btn-primary portal-btn-lg">开始使用</button>
                <button class="portal-btn portal-btn-outline portal-btn-lg">查看文档</button>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box class="portal-stats">
        <Box class="portal-stats-inner">
            <Box class="portal-stat">
                <Text class="portal-stat-number">12万+</Text>
                <Text class="portal-stat-label">开发者</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box class="portal-stat">
                <Text class="portal-stat-number">98%</Text>
                <Text class="portal-stat-label">部署成功率</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box class="portal-stat">
                <Text class="portal-stat-number">89</Text>
                <Text class="portal-stat-label">组件</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box class="portal-stat">
                <Text class="portal-stat-number">9</Text>
                <Text class="portal-stat-label">平台目标</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box class="portal-section">
        <Box class="portal-section-inner">
            <Box class="portal-section-head">
                <Text class="portal-section-eyebrow">特性</Text>
                <Text class="portal-section-title">核心特性</Text>
                <Text class="portal-section-subtitle">为现代全栈应用而生的工程能力</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box class="portal-features-grid">
                <Box class="portal-feature-card">
                    <Box class="portal-feature-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-feature-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
                            <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
                            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-title">跨平台一致</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-desc">一套代码，九个平台目标。Web、小程序、原生应用共享同一组件树与样式系统。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-feature-card">
                    <Box class="portal-feature-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-feature-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-title">AOT 一体化优化</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-desc">提前编译消除运行时开销，组件树、样式与脚本统一优化，产出极致体积与性能。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-feature-card">
                    <Box class="portal-feature-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-feature-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-title">类型安全</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-desc">从 props 到事件，从样式到状态，全链路静态类型检查，错误在编译期暴露。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-feature-card">
                    <Box class="portal-feature-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-feature-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                            <path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20" />
                            <path d="M2 12h20" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-title">响应式主题</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-feature-desc">六套主题、明暗双模、CSS 变量驱动，运行时切换无重渲染，系统偏好自动适配。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box class="portal-section portal-section-alt">
        <Box class="portal-section-inner">
            <Box class="portal-section-head">
                <Text class="portal-section-eyebrow">方案</Text>
                <Text class="portal-section-title">解决方案</Text>
                <Text class="portal-section-subtitle">覆盖典型业务场景的开箱即用方案</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box class="portal-solutions-grid">
                <Box class="portal-solution-card">
                    <Box class="portal-solution-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-solution-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" />
                            <path d="M9 22v-4h6v4" />
                            <path d="M8 6h.01M16 6h.01M8 10h.01M16 10h.01M8 14h.01M16 14h.01" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-title">企业门户</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-desc">面向企业的品牌门户与内部协同入口，支持多语言、权限分级与单点登录集成。</Text>
                    <a class="portal-solution-link" href="#">
                        了解更多
                        <svg class="portal-solution-link-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
                            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-solution-card">
                    <Box class="portal-solution-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-solution-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
                            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-title">社区运营</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-desc">为社群与内容创作者打造的高互动运营平台，内置会员体系、活动管理与数据看板。</Text>
                    <a class="portal-solution-link" href="#">
                        了解更多
                        <svg class="portal-solution-link-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
                            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-solution-card">
                    <Box class="portal-solution-icon-wrap">
                        <svg class="portal-solution-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2" />
                            <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17" />
                            <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12" />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-title">内容平台</Text>
                    <Text class="portal-solution-desc">支持富文本、多媒体与多端分发的内容管理平台，提供编辑工作流与发布审批能力。</Text>
                    <a class="portal-solution-link" href="#">
                        了解更多
                        <svg class="portal-solution-link-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
                            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box class="portal-cta-banner">
        <Box class="portal-cta-inner">
            <Text class="portal-cta-title">准备好开始了吗？</Text>
            <Text class="portal-cta-subtitle">几分钟内初始化项目，立刻体验全栈一致的开发流程。</Text>
            <button class="portal-btn portal-btn-primary portal-btn-lg">立即开始</button>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box class="portal-footer">
        <Box class="portal-footer-inner">
            <Box class="portal-footer-grid">
                <Box class="portal-footer-col">
                    <Text class="portal-footer-title">产品</Text>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">组件库</a>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">主题系统</a>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">CLI 工具</a>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-footer-col">
                    <Text class="portal-footer-title">资源</Text>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">文档</a>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">教程</a>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">示例</a>
                </Box>
                <Box class="portal-footer-col">
                    <Text class="portal-footer-title">公司</Text>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">关于</a>
                    <a class="portal-footer-link" href="#">博客</a>
